cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhysGuard in your research, please cite the NeurIPS 2026 paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "PhysGuard: Fisher-Guided Gradient Projection for Sim-to-Real Neural PDE Surrogates"
abstract: "Official implementation of PhysGuard (NeurIPS 2026). PhysGuard uses the empirical Fisher Information Matrix of a simulation-pretrained neural PDE surrogate to identify physics-critical parameter directions and projects real-data fine-tuning gradients into their null space, preserving learned physics during sim-to-real adaptation."
